OBJETIVO
=========================================================================

Crear un:

ACCOUNTING QUERY MODEL

que represente las capacidades financieras de Aurum mediante un
modelo de consulta desacoplado de la persistencia.

El modelo debe permitir consultar:

Accounts

Balances

Profitability

Financial Ratios

Cash Flow

Financial KPIs

Data Quality

Financial Comparisons

